WEBVTT

01:00.390 --> 01:07.230
It is said that 70% of the
human brain's capacity is unused.

01:09.230 --> 01:11.290
It's also thought that...

01:11.870 --> 01:15.060
...the mysterious powers that humans
have are hidden in this part of the brain.

01:17.010 --> 01:21.570
The 70% of the brain that is not used...

01:22.340 --> 01:24.070
...is often called this...

01:24.150 --> 01:29.880
<i>Night Head Genesis</i>

02:19.700 --> 02:20.970
<i>Wandering</i>

02:20.970 --> 02:24.870
<i>Wandering
Episode 23</i>

02:31.250 --> 02:32.580
Mr. Naoto Kirihara...

02:34.550 --> 02:35.640
We're here.

02:35.950 --> 02:36.880
Yes...

02:40.460 --> 02:41.350
It's here?

02:41.520 --> 02:44.050
Yes, this is our laboratory.

02:44.130 --> 02:45.250
Please come this way.

02:46.800 --> 02:49.030
Did you see the world
map drawn in crayon?

02:49.100 --> 02:49.960
Yes.

02:50.530 --> 02:53.060
She still continues to
draw the same picture.

02:53.270 --> 02:58.040
She doesn't take breaks and
draws many copies of it each day.

02:59.070 --> 03:02.270
But in the past couple of days,
there has been a change in the drawing.

03:03.080 --> 03:05.910
It's being blackened in little by little.

03:06.380 --> 03:09.210
Spreading its spacing out
by a small amount each day.

03:10.090 --> 03:12.520
Those are overlapping with
the red zones all over the world.

03:12.590 --> 03:17.490
Areas affected by dispute,
disease, and natural disasters.

03:17.930 --> 03:20.450
It seems like it's
some kind of warning.

03:23.330 --> 03:25.200
Naji, estimated to be five years old.

03:25.330 --> 03:28.430
She was brought to our
laboratory a month ago.

03:29.340 --> 03:33.270
It seems like she's not awakened,
but she acts as an antenna.

03:34.140 --> 03:37.580
She's a war orphan and
she has closed off her heart.

03:37.910 --> 03:41.510
But when we gave her
crayons, she started drawing.

03:41.580 --> 03:42.480
Drawings?

03:42.550 --> 03:47.210
She doesn't eat, sleep,
or even collapse.

03:47.820 --> 03:50.120
She just draws.

03:52.260 --> 03:53.690
This is that drawing.

03:57.000 --> 03:58.690
This was drawn by a five year old?

03:59.130 --> 03:59.900
That's right.

03:59.970 --> 04:03.100
Even if you copied from a map,
it wouldn't be drawn this precisely.

04:03.710 --> 04:05.700
She draws many
copies of this every day.

04:05.940 --> 04:08.970
I think there's some kind
of strong message, but...

04:10.040 --> 04:10.840
And?

04:11.010 --> 04:14.970
What's the reason for coming back from
Moscow for the first time in a year and a half?

04:15.550 --> 04:18.680
Would you go over there
and see her with your own eyes?

04:19.250 --> 04:21.450
With your powers...

04:21.520 --> 04:22.390
...see what she is trying to convey.

04:22.390 --> 04:23.520
...see what she is trying to convey.
We refuse!

04:26.860 --> 04:30.520
We don't want to be part of
disputes and troubles anymore.

04:30.730 --> 04:33.860
This past year and a half,
Naoya and I have been living peacefully.

04:34.840 --> 04:35.890
Leave us alone.

04:36.500 --> 04:37.490
Naoto...

04:42.680 --> 04:43.270
Naoya!

04:45.380 --> 04:46.310
Brother...

04:46.480 --> 04:47.740
The world is...

04:51.720 --> 04:52.580
Naoya!

04:52.790 --> 04:53.910
What's wrong, Naoya!

04:53.990 --> 04:54.850
Naoya!

04:57.530 --> 04:58.720
I'm sorry.

04:59.290 --> 05:01.320
I didn't think something
like this would happen.

05:01.760 --> 05:06.700
Maybe the impact was too harsh on
Naoya who has been living peacefully.

05:12.170 --> 05:14.970
Can I ask you to take care of Naoya?

05:16.740 --> 05:20.370
I'm going to see with my
own eyes what Naoya saw.

05:22.520 --> 05:23.580
That's Naji.

05:27.360 --> 05:29.550
It seems as she
was hit by a gunshot.

05:30.230 --> 05:36.190
She was born in a place where dying
is as common as breathing or eating.

05:36.560 --> 05:38.860
This is something she just finished.

05:39.770 --> 05:40.700
This is...

05:41.300 --> 05:42.700
Please look at this.

05:43.270 --> 05:46.330
This is the enlarged version
of your country, Japan.

05:47.340 --> 05:51.440
I'm sure you can tell from this,
but the shorelines have changed.

05:52.050 --> 05:54.670
It's the same for other lands too...

05:54.820 --> 06:01.050
...but it's a gradual change
as if a bug ate away at it.

06:01.260 --> 06:02.220
Naji!

06:08.000 --> 06:10.490
Naji never puts her crayon down...

06:19.510 --> 06:20.630
It's okay...

06:20.940 --> 06:22.070
It's okay now...

06:54.480 --> 06:56.270
Did you find out something?

06:56.340 --> 06:59.110
Yeah, Naji's powers are real.

06:59.780 --> 07:04.240
I'm not the best at reading,
but I feel the energy from the message.

07:04.820 --> 07:07.750
The potential of her powers
might be greater than ours.

07:07.990 --> 07:09.650
The content of the prediction is?

07:09.820 --> 07:13.850
I think it's pointing to a disaster
happening that will affect the whole world.

07:14.660 --> 07:17.430
Since I came here, I've been
seeing the same dream over and over.

07:18.870 --> 07:22.230
I think that is most likely
also a message from Naji.

07:22.400 --> 07:24.230
What is going to happen?

07:24.310 --> 07:25.270
A war?

07:25.410 --> 07:26.340
An accident?

07:26.410 --> 07:27.430
I don't know.

07:28.380 --> 07:30.840
I'll come back over there
with the picture Naji drew.

07:30.910 --> 07:32.310
We'll talk more in detail then.

07:33.720 --> 07:35.150
How's Naoya doing?

07:35.850 --> 07:37.610
He's recovered a lot.

07:38.050 --> 07:39.850
We don't have to worry anymore.

07:39.920 --> 07:40.890
Is that so...

07:48.460 --> 07:49.360
Naji!

07:53.570 --> 07:54.500
What's the matter?

07:54.570 --> 07:56.560
It looks like she was looking for you.

07:59.110 --> 08:00.130
What is it?

08:04.680 --> 08:06.510
This is the message from Naji.

08:09.620 --> 08:10.950
Naji drew that.

08:12.150 --> 08:14.020
You knew about Naoya?

08:17.490 --> 08:18.980
N-Naji...

08:19.590 --> 08:20.860
...smiled!

08:20.930 --> 08:23.590
Naji, you don't have
to worry anymore.

08:24.170 --> 08:26.260
We will take care of the rest.

08:39.210 --> 08:40.510
Brother!

08:44.650 --> 08:46.480
Naoya, are you okay now?

08:46.550 --> 08:48.850
Yeah, I'm sorry to worry you.

08:48.920 --> 08:50.080
I'm okay now.

08:50.760 --> 08:52.520
Is that so? I'm glad.

08:53.630 --> 08:55.790
I was handed a message from Naji.

08:55.900 --> 08:58.590
The only one who
could accept this is you.

08:58.800 --> 09:02.260
But this will make you have
to deal with sadness again.

09:03.470 --> 09:04.940
I'm fine, Brother.

09:05.870 --> 09:09.210
There is a five year old child risking
her life trying to convey something.

09:09.440 --> 09:11.410
I have to accept it.

09:13.880 --> 09:15.370
I'm relying on you, Naoya.

09:15.550 --> 09:16.310
Okay.

09:19.650 --> 09:24.350
Japan has deformed
more than the drawing I saw.

09:24.690 --> 09:28.060
The parts that are
blackened out have spread more.

09:28.530 --> 09:32.560
The mark is maybe around Shizuoka.

09:32.800 --> 09:35.390
Is there some kind of
key there or something?

09:39.340 --> 09:41.810
Oh, sorry. I was
looking at this drawing.

09:41.880 --> 09:45.370
It's as if Naji is floating between me and
Brother's legs.

09:46.080 --> 09:47.140
Naoya...

09:47.750 --> 09:49.220
I'm going to do it, Brother.

09:49.480 --> 09:51.450
I got strength from Naji.

09:55.090 --> 09:56.720
Be careful, Naoya.

10:02.760 --> 10:03.860
This is...

10:16.940 --> 10:17.880
Naoya!

10:19.510 --> 10:20.640
Brother...

10:20.780 --> 10:21.750
Get it together.

10:23.380 --> 10:25.410
Yeah, I'm okay now.

10:25.720 --> 10:29.050
The drawing that Naji
did of us held me together.

10:29.520 --> 10:31.520
There was a lot less impact than before.

10:31.660 --> 10:32.720
Is that so...

10:33.190 --> 10:35.660
So what did you see?

10:36.360 --> 10:39.090
I saw a big clock tower fall apart.

10:39.670 --> 10:41.860
And... what was it?

10:42.370 --> 10:46.310
It looked like... a weirdly
shaped shrine entrance arch.

10:47.380 --> 10:50.210
Before you leave for Moscow,
please take care of this one job.

10:50.280 --> 10:51.210
Understood.

10:51.280 --> 10:55.220
The area of the symbol,
along with a clock tower and a shrine.

10:55.320 --> 10:56.440
I'll look into it right away.

10:57.690 --> 10:58.710
Brother.

10:59.020 --> 11:00.990
Furious evil and hatred...

11:01.290 --> 11:04.020
I can feel the negative
energy so much that it hurts.

11:04.960 --> 11:05.980
What is...

11:06.230 --> 11:08.220
What is trying to happen?

11:20.610 --> 11:22.100
Is that it, Naoya?

11:22.540 --> 11:24.570
Yeah, there's no mistake.

11:25.080 --> 11:26.880
Okay, the next is the shrine.

11:26.950 --> 11:27.780
Yeah.

11:28.450 --> 11:30.880
As I said, it hasn't arrived yet!

11:31.020 --> 11:33.320
The tent and the 20
chairs for the check-in!

11:33.390 --> 11:35.620
The event is the day after tomorrow.

11:39.790 --> 11:41.190
Naoya, what's wrong?

11:42.060 --> 11:43.890
Sorry. It's nothing.

11:44.130 --> 11:45.430
I understand.

11:45.500 --> 11:47.160
Please take care of this right away!

11:55.910 --> 11:56.810
Miss Namikawa.

11:56.880 --> 11:58.370
Yes... Mr. Ikuta!

11:59.050 --> 12:00.740
It seems like you're busy.

12:01.150 --> 12:02.010
No...

12:02.780 --> 12:05.220
Miss Namikawa, as you also know...

12:05.290 --> 12:09.850
...Councilor Gouda has put a lot of
his power into this region's development.

12:10.730 --> 12:13.290
He is trying to make
this event a turning point...

12:13.360 --> 12:18.590
...to bring back all the tourists
that have stopped since that event.

12:18.670 --> 12:19.630
Yes...

12:19.730 --> 12:22.970
I'm sure that was
damaging your father too.

12:23.400 --> 12:27.030
He announced that there was
going to be a disastrous earthquake...

12:27.110 --> 12:29.010
...in this region,
but he was totally wrong.

12:29.080 --> 12:33.410
Until then, he was said to
be a leader in his field.

12:33.480 --> 12:35.780
My father is reflecting upon it.

12:35.920 --> 12:39.110
Well, I'm not blaming you for it.

12:39.190 --> 12:40.180
It's just...

12:40.250 --> 12:42.690
...that kind of chaos is something
we never want to deal with.

12:42.760 --> 12:44.990
The town is putting their
hopes on this event too.

12:45.160 --> 12:48.620
They are working really hard
to restore their fallen image.

12:49.330 --> 12:50.390
Yes...

12:57.640 --> 12:59.200
How is it, Naoya?

13:00.940 --> 13:02.470
It wasn't like this...

13:02.540 --> 13:04.810
It had a special kind of shape.

13:04.980 --> 13:06.000
Special?

13:06.150 --> 13:08.480
All right, Dad, I'll clean this up.

13:08.620 --> 13:09.740
Yeah, thanks.

13:18.290 --> 13:20.490
May I ask what this study is for?

13:20.800 --> 13:23.090
I'm sorry. I didn't mean to scare you.

13:23.160 --> 13:24.260
You two!

13:25.100 --> 13:26.570
Are you from the municipal office?

13:27.770 --> 13:29.630
We are tourists!

13:30.640 --> 13:31.800
Excuse us.

13:31.870 --> 13:33.970
We are a little nervous
about something.

13:34.610 --> 13:37.340
This is a machine that
measures the amount of magnetism...

13:37.410 --> 13:39.310
...that is radiating from the
ground by interpreting it as a number.

13:39.380 --> 13:41.440
Observation of the magnetic field?

13:41.520 --> 13:43.380
Is it a study on earthquakes?

13:44.020 --> 13:45.780
Are you interested?

13:46.350 --> 13:48.150
To be honest, from the data here...

13:48.220 --> 13:50.320
...there was a reading of a possibility...

13:50.390 --> 13:53.290
...of an earthquake, so I was
researching from different angles.

13:53.360 --> 13:57.130
"Different angles"?
What other ways are you studying it?

13:57.300 --> 13:59.230
With the signals from plants.

13:59.300 --> 14:00.530
Plants?

14:00.770 --> 14:03.430
Hey, if you want, would you
like to come see it at our home?

14:03.500 --> 14:04.940
Yes, please.

14:12.310 --> 14:15.040
This machine records
how the magnetism...

14:15.120 --> 14:18.050
...that radiates from the
ground affects the plants.

14:18.420 --> 14:20.940
It's like an
electro-cardiogram for a plant!

14:21.020 --> 14:22.010
Right?

14:22.160 --> 14:24.720
How accurately are
you able to figure it out?

14:25.190 --> 14:28.060
The probability of the earthquake
is only about 80% right now.

14:28.700 --> 14:30.030
80%?

14:30.100 --> 14:31.330
That's amazing.

14:31.570 --> 14:34.500
But the problem is the last 20%.

14:34.900 --> 14:37.870
If I was able to read
the signals from the plants a little better...

14:38.110 --> 14:39.830
The signals from the plants?

14:40.840 --> 14:42.370
Excuse me for a moment.

14:42.680 --> 14:47.010
It's time for all of the data
from the meters to be gathered, so...

14:52.850 --> 14:56.050
Dad was put to tears by that 20%.

14:56.120 --> 14:56.990
What?

14:57.060 --> 15:00.030
Three years ago, he made an
announcement that a large earthquake...

15:00.090 --> 15:03.030
...was going to come and be
a disaster, but he was wrong.

15:03.700 --> 15:07.260
He brought a big financial
burden to this region...

15:07.330 --> 15:10.330
...and since then the municipal
government has been watching him...

15:10.400 --> 15:13.970
...but if he quits, there will be
many victims, so he won't quit.

15:14.710 --> 15:16.900
T-This can't be...

15:17.480 --> 15:20.380
If a real earthquake came,
it'd be a disaster.

15:20.580 --> 15:23.850
I at least have to try
to support him, you know...

15:24.650 --> 15:25.780
Because we're family.

15:25.850 --> 15:26.980
This is bad!

15:27.920 --> 15:28.910
An earthquake!

15:29.120 --> 15:30.650
A large earthquake is coming!

15:30.720 --> 15:32.560
Within the next three days!

15:32.630 --> 15:33.490
What did you say?

15:33.690 --> 15:35.630
I collected unbelievable data!

15:35.700 --> 15:37.060
Stop it!

15:38.530 --> 15:39.500
Sis!

15:40.130 --> 15:41.230
Hitomi...

15:41.300 --> 15:44.530
If you start saying such a thing,
then we're done for!

15:44.610 --> 15:46.100
Stop it, Sis!

15:46.310 --> 15:49.830
If an earthquake comes now,
there's going to be a lot of victims!

15:49.910 --> 15:54.570
Are you trying to push me and Lena,
victims of yours, even more?

15:54.650 --> 15:55.710
Sis...

15:59.550 --> 16:01.890
Please forgive me, Hitomi, Lena...

16:02.320 --> 16:06.190
But because I saw this data,
I cannot keep quiet about it!

16:07.290 --> 16:10.260
Dad, then you're going to announce it?

16:10.460 --> 16:11.950
Wait, Dad!

16:12.030 --> 16:13.290
Wait! No!

16:14.700 --> 16:15.930
Dad!

16:16.840 --> 16:17.830
Open up!

16:17.910 --> 16:20.140
Please open this door and come out!

16:20.610 --> 16:21.910
Please stop!

16:22.080 --> 16:26.950
You know how I feel working
at the municipal building, right?

16:27.280 --> 16:31.080
And you know what is
happening to Lena at school, right?

16:31.490 --> 16:32.540
I beg you!

16:33.020 --> 16:35.320
Please don't make us
suffer any more than this!

16:35.590 --> 16:36.580
Please...

16:39.030 --> 16:41.050
Why does something
like this have to happen?

16:41.460 --> 16:43.520
We didn't do anything bad to anyone.

17:01.950 --> 17:03.440
Yes, how can I help you?

17:03.520 --> 17:04.640
Miss Namikawa.

17:04.720 --> 17:05.810
Mr. Ikuta!

17:06.320 --> 17:08.620
What is the meaning of this!

17:08.690 --> 17:11.750
<i>Earthquake Prediction Information
Kouichi Namikawa
Immediate Evacuation Notice!</i>

17:12.860 --> 17:13.830
This is...

17:15.100 --> 17:16.060
No...

17:16.200 --> 17:17.530
Not again...

17:17.800 --> 17:21.100
It says within three days,
but the event is tomorrow.

17:21.370 --> 17:24.060
We need to meet with your father
and get him to take this page...

17:24.140 --> 17:25.040
That's...

17:28.180 --> 17:30.410
He's trying to go to
the TV station again, huh?

17:30.580 --> 17:31.700
Hurry and stop him!

17:31.780 --> 17:32.910
Y-Yes!

17:35.250 --> 17:36.410
Dad...

17:39.420 --> 17:42.150
No one is trying to understand Dad.

17:44.890 --> 17:47.590
If I don't hurry,
it's going to be a disaster!

17:51.430 --> 17:52.400
Naoto?

17:52.670 --> 17:54.000
Move! Move it!

17:54.070 --> 17:55.400
I'm in a hurry!

18:00.440 --> 18:01.740
What? What just...

18:02.280 --> 18:03.240
Damn it!

18:03.510 --> 18:04.910
Damn it! Damn it!

18:05.880 --> 18:06.850
Calm down!

18:06.910 --> 18:08.040
Cool your head.

18:08.120 --> 18:09.810
If you don't,
no one is going to believe you!

18:09.880 --> 18:12.550
But I have to tell the truth!

18:12.620 --> 18:13.880
I know.

18:14.220 --> 18:17.280
But, if the earthquake is really
coming, what would happen...

18:17.360 --> 18:22.260
...if people just run for the streets
and trains in this short amount of time!

18:23.260 --> 18:24.990
If the earthquake
came at a time like that...

18:25.070 --> 18:27.000
...it wouldn't save anyone!

18:27.200 --> 18:28.330
But...

18:28.500 --> 18:30.560
What am I supposed to do?

18:30.940 --> 18:34.570
You have to think of a way to prevent
the damage as much as possible.

18:35.510 --> 18:36.940
For now, head back to your house.

18:37.010 --> 18:38.140
Then go from there.

18:38.750 --> 18:40.480
The car isn't moving.

18:40.710 --> 18:41.770
It will move.

18:52.430 --> 18:53.720
Naoya...

19:00.200 --> 19:02.100
Naji, is that you?

19:02.640 --> 19:03.730
Naoya...

19:13.080 --> 19:14.170
Naji?

19:40.840 --> 19:43.440
These are events of the past.

19:43.710 --> 19:45.650
The other side of time...

19:45.910 --> 19:49.010
What I want you to see is in the sky.

19:56.660 --> 19:58.630
This is the symbol of evil.

19:58.830 --> 20:00.230
The negative energy...

20:01.360 --> 20:04.890
The power to make this
stronger exists everywhere.

20:05.300 --> 20:06.730
Within animals...

20:06.870 --> 20:08.490
Within plants...

20:08.900 --> 20:11.300
And even inside the earth...

20:11.770 --> 20:12.760
An earthquake?

20:17.480 --> 20:18.340
Naji!

20:20.450 --> 20:21.310
Wait up!

20:24.320 --> 20:25.310
Lena?

20:25.490 --> 20:28.180
Sorry. I heard where your hotel was, so...

20:29.090 --> 20:31.610
I don't know where Dad went...

20:31.690 --> 20:32.820
I'm sorry.

20:33.090 --> 20:36.120
I don't have anyone else
I can talk to about this.

20:36.760 --> 20:38.600
We were concerned
about yesterday too...

20:38.670 --> 20:40.790
...so Brother left in the morning.

20:40.900 --> 20:42.770
For the time being,
we should go to your house.

20:43.500 --> 20:44.200
Yes!

20:44.710 --> 20:46.730
If I can't do anything now...

20:46.810 --> 20:49.740
...for what reason did
I continue this research?

20:50.140 --> 20:52.270
Troublesome company is waiting.

21:01.260 --> 21:03.450
I have something
ready over here too.

21:03.720 --> 21:05.490
I'm risking my life too!

21:05.560 --> 21:06.220
Stop!

21:06.290 --> 21:07.090
But!

21:07.160 --> 21:10.890
Who is going to believe the words
of a man swinging a gun around?

21:17.740 --> 21:18.930
Professor!

21:19.010 --> 21:21.070
Professor, you're a
troublesome person.

21:21.140 --> 21:23.340
You know the rules, right?

21:23.740 --> 21:25.210
If you're going to live in this region...

21:25.280 --> 21:28.370
...you have to do things
that are profitable for everyone.

21:28.450 --> 21:29.850
This is the second time.

21:29.920 --> 21:32.480
This time we're going
to punish you a little.

21:34.020 --> 21:35.010
Brother!

21:35.860 --> 21:36.750
The sky!

21:36.920 --> 21:38.080
The sky is...

21:42.900 --> 21:44.120
What is that?

21:44.360 --> 21:45.260
Aurora?

21:45.330 --> 21:47.100
Because of the sudden
change in the Earth's crust...

21:47.170 --> 21:49.070
...it's causing an abnormality
in the electromagnetic field!

21:49.770 --> 21:51.500
This is your doing too, huh?

21:51.770 --> 21:52.500
Why you!

21:52.570 --> 21:53.560
Dad!

22:00.680 --> 22:01.770
What just happened?

22:10.490 --> 22:13.120
It's coming! It's the sign
of a large earthquake!

22:18.070 --> 22:19.230
The evil...

22:19.430 --> 22:22.130
The dreadful evil is
coming out of the ground.

22:31.250 --> 22:34.510
<i>An exact answer is nowhere.</i>

22:34.580 --> 22:37.180
<i>Even if you corner it, it still runs.</i>

22:37.250 --> 22:41.850
<i>It's that kind of repeating all the time.</i>

22:41.920 --> 22:45.150
<i>We hurt each other
and rip each other apart.</i>

22:45.230 --> 22:47.850
<i>We're complaining once again.</i>

22:47.930 --> 22:53.260
<i>When tomorrow comes, just like a lie,
you wear a mask and live on.</i>

22:53.330 --> 22:58.640
<i>I was wishing upon
the night stars...</i>

22:58.710 --> 23:03.970
<i>...for our distance
to become shorter.</i>

23:04.040 --> 23:10.680
<i>But if I try to bluff,
then I'm going to regret it.</i>

23:10.750 --> 23:13.220
<i>Words and feelings are reverse.</i>

23:13.290 --> 23:18.850
<i>Feelings that were asleep,
heart that was asleep, lure it out!</i>

23:18.930 --> 23:24.190
<i>Glamour that was asleep, myself
that was asleep, with your power!</i>

23:24.260 --> 23:29.730
<i>Please look at me quietly with the soul
that you cannot top more than this.</i>

23:29.800 --> 23:34.600
<i>I want you to go wilder inside me.</i>

23:34.680 --> 23:40.140
<i>Eyes that were asleep, emotions
that were asleep, wake them up!</i>

23:40.210 --> 23:45.480
<i>Memories that were asleep, dreams
that were asleep, with your power!</i>

23:45.550 --> 23:51.010
<i>Please melt me with the vision of kindness
that you cannot top more than this.</i>

23:51.090 --> 23:58.190
<i>I want to stay asleep
longer buried inside you.</i>

24:02.300 --> 24:04.600
The meaning behind our powers...

24:05.240 --> 24:09.500
The agony
and shock that attacked us.

24:10.340 --> 24:12.510
The power to smash through
the chain reaction.

24:13.280 --> 24:15.810
The power for
tomorrow's regeneration.

24:16.780 --> 24:20.950
And our wishes pass
through space-time.

24:22.490 --> 24:29.850
<i>Episode 24, "Hope"</i>

24:25.890 --> 24:28.830
To the land we searched for.
